  "content": "<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果不看礦物，能通關 Minecraft 嗎？</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">我覺得有可能！<br /></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">這個資源包會把礦物的材質變成石頭！這會為遊戲增加硬核難度！<br />有了它，你可以試試自己的運氣，也可以在伺服器上安裝它來惡搞朋友！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">截圖：</span><br /></strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/396/352/skrinshot-22-09-2021-162421.png\" /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/396/353/skrinshot-22-09-2021-162432.png\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><del><strong>官方影片：</strong></del></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>更多影片：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;俄語：由「<a class=\"yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string\" dir=\"auto\" spellcheck=\"false\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/PhantomWay\">Phantom Way</a>」製作</span><br /><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EF0d4GbEBwg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
